-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §100: first deputies in a primary school
-- (special-education ones of grades 1–6, 1–8 or 1–9 included) on the
-- junior-high base of 24 weekly hours are converted under §49.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-49`
§ `100`

-- ¶1 is the heading line of ¶2's rule.
@ref akn:art_100 akn:art_100/p2
GIVEN s IS A `status`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's Y on the 24-hour base in a primary school` s IS
    `Y on the 24-hour base in a primary school` s
